/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/T (Customers finalize their purchase choosing the colour of the ring and the size, aided by a sizing kit that helps them select the right ring size. The kit, available for free online or in-store, comes with video instructions to ensure proper use. For online purchases, customers enjoy zero-interest financing \(with payments deferred to a later date\) and free shipping. Expert assistance is also available throughout the process, ensuring a smooth and confident buying experience. )
/E (Customers finalize their purchase choosing the colour of the ring and the size, aided by a sizing kit that helps them select the right ring size. The kit, available for free online or in-store, comes with video instructions to ensure proper use. For online purchases, customers enjoy zero-interest financing \(with payments deferred to a later date\) and free shipping. Expert assistance is also available throughout the process, ensuring a smooth and confident buying experience. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
