<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/T (Since the Samsung Galaxy Smart Ring is newly launched, it is too early to fully assess customer loyalty. However, the brand's reputation for quality and innovation plays a crucial role in customer retention. Samsung's established trust with consumers, along with strong post-purchase support such as expert consultations and accessible customer service, helps build a foundation for future loyalty. These elements, combined with the product's seamless integration into the Samsung ecosystem, set the stage for ongoing customer satisfaction.)
/E (Since the Samsung Galaxy Smart Ring is newly launched, it is too early to fully assess customer loyalty. However, the brand's reputation for quality and innovation plays a crucial role in customer retention. Samsung's established trust with consumers, along with strong post-purchase support such as expert consultations and accessible customer service, helps build a foundation for future loyalty. These elements, combined with the product's seamless integration into the Samsung ecosystem, set the stage for ongoing customer satisfaction.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [17]
>>
