<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To earn media, Samsung should focus on promoting exceptional product quality and innovative features, particularly during the initial phases when the product is still new and unfamiliar. At this stage, the emphasis should be on encouraging genuine reviews and user-generated content to highlight the smart ring's capabilities. Generating unboxing content with product ambassadors will be crucial for building excitement and visibility.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
1134 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This approach should help spark word-of-mouth momentum and positive social media reviews. As the campaign progresses, collaborating with prominent bloggers will become more relevant. These partnerships can produce long-form content that showcases the product's day-to-day usability and long-term benefits, helping to sustain interest and engagement over time.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [25]
>>
