1311 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To estimate the expected audience for our campaign, we began with the total Italian population and made specific assumptions to arrive at a reliable result. We built a marketing funnel, a tool used to map out the customer journey through various stages until the purchase moment.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
1312 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The Italian population is approximately 59 million, and the average age is 40 years. We are considering individuals over the age of 39 \(about 58% of the population\) who are employed \(62.5%\). These filters help narrow our audience to a relevant segment for our campaign, ensuring we target a demographic aligned with our goals and the product's value proposition.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1313 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (We find in this way an estimate of the amount of people getting the awareness phase. )
/Alt ()
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
