/S /P
/E (From the population of adults who are employed, we further narrow our focus to individuals genuinely interested in health and smart devices. According to a the statistics 76% of this group has such an interest, we arrive at a refined estimate of the number of people engaged in the interest phase of the marketing funnel. This calculation ensures that our campaign targets a highly relevant audience likely to resonate with the Galaxy Ring's features.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [5]
>>
