1323 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To transition from the desire phase to the purchase phase, we estimate that 15% of individuals in the desire phase complete the transaction. This percentage reflects typical behavior in the tech and wearable markets. Factors like price sensitivity, competition, immediate need, and trust in the product often influence the drop-off. However, this rate also highlights the importance of addressing barriers and enhancing the value proposition to maximize conversion rates.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
