<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (3.923.500 x 15% = 487.635)
/Alt ()
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
1325 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (In this way, we have identified our target audience: 487,635 individuals. This serves as the foundation for estimating the expected profit from our campaign. With this figure, we can calculate key performance indicators such as ROI \(Return on Investment\) and ROMI \(Return on Marketing Investment\), allowing us to evaluate the campaign's financial effectiveness and strategic impact.)
