1390 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To estimate the total cost of the digital campaign, we began by determining the number of impressions \(views\) for each campaign element. For each element, we assigned a plausible Click-Through Rate \(CTR\) to calculate the expected number of clicks. Based on this, we applied a Cost Per Click \(CPC\) to determine the cost associated with each element. This systematic approach ensures a precise allocation of budget for the digital campaign, allowing us to evaluate its efficiency and impact.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [48]
>>
endobj
