/Alt ()
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [49]
>>
endobj
1392 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (To break down the cost of the TV advertising campaign, we considered major components: the broadcasting fee to allow the transmission, the production cost for creating the campaign, and additional miscellaneous expenses such as licensing, talent fees, and post-production. Each of these factors contributes to the overall expenditure required to effectively air the campaign on television.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [54]
>>
endobj
1393 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
